---
---

<section class="built" aria-labelledby="built-title">
  <div class="built-copy">
    <h2 id="built-title">Built for John Jay students.</h2>
    <p class="built-lede">
      JJAY is an independent student-built campus companion designed to make everyday campus
      information easier to find.
    </p>
    <p class="built-disclaimer">
      JJAY is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or maintained by John Jay College of Criminal
      Justice or the City University of New York.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="built-aside">
    <span class="built-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.8"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
      >
        <path d="M2.5 9.5 12 5l9.5 4.5L12 14z"></path>
        <path d="M6 11.75V16c0 1.5 2.7 3 6 3s6-1.5 6-3v-4.25"></path>
        <path d="M21.5 9.5V15"></path>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <p>A helpful tool, built by a John Jay student, for John Jay students.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .built {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 32px 48px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 44px 48px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eaf2fd 0%, #f3f7fe 55%, #e6effc 100%);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--home-hairline);
  }

  .built h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.625rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.625rem, 2.6vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 760;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--home-ink);
  }

  .built-lede {
    margin: 0 0 0.875rem;
    max-width: 58ch;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .built-disclaimer {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 62ch;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .built-aside {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    width: 300px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--home-hairline);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .built-aside p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 550;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--home-ink);
  }

  .built-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--home-blue);
    background: #e4eaf6;
  }

  .built-icon svg {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .built {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 36px 28px;
      border-radius: 24px;
    }

    .built-aside {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .built {
      padding: 28px 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
